## Ignore Visual Studio temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular Visual Studio add-ons.
##
## Get latest from https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/master/VisualStudio.gitignore

# User-specific files
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.json
!.vscode/mcp.json
!.mcp.json
!.github/hooks/*.json
!tools/kg/seed/*.json
!tools/kg/kg-codegen/KgCodegen.Tests/Fixtures/*.json
# Test-run config for the two newer E2E projects. The older test projects already
# track theirs; these were swallowed by *.json above, which left each project's xunit
# parallelization setting untracked and made appsettings.test.json (loaded with
# optional: false) missing on a fresh clone. For ECommerceApp.E2E.Backend that matters
# most: it deliberately runs sequentially against one shared SQL Server container, and
# without its xunit.runner.json a clone silently defaults to parallel collections.
!ECommerceApp.Web.E2E/xunit.runner.json
!ECommerceApp.Web.E2E/appsettings.test.json
!ECommerceApp.E2E.Backend/xunit.runner.json
!ECommerceApp.E2E.Backend/appsettings.test.json
*.config
*.doc
*.docx

# User-specific files (MonoDevelop/Xamarin Studio)
*.userprefs

